\ Strict (interpreter-free) variant of aot_user_struct.1z. Every
\ struct-generator-emitted word must AOT-compile with no interpreter
\ fallback. The constructor, predicate, and positional unwrap all
\ route through the slot-table push helpers.

point: struct{ x y } ;

2 3 make-point unmake-point + .
4 5 make-point point? .
"not-a-point" point? .
99 -1 make-point unmake-point + .
